{"id": "fb977442-8b2e-4af2-84b3-bd77cfaf07f2", "slug": "retry-sunset-landing", "title": "Retry Sunset Landing", "description": "Retry Sunset UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Retry Sunset Landing\"\ndescription: \"Retry Sunset UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#E07A5F\"\n  secondary: \"#2C1610\"\n  accent: \"#D9C5B2\"\n  background: \"#D9C5B2\"\n  surface: \"#2C1610\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Retry Sunset Landing\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 3; favorites: 2; remixes: 0.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, effect.\n## Overview\nRetry Sunset UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nRetry Sunset. Earthworks\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Retry; Sunset..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #E07A5F, secondary #2C1610, accent #D9C5B2, background #D9C5B2, surface #2C1610, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Retry Sunset Landing</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#D9C5B2] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-12 font-sans text-white antialiased overflow-hidden selection:bg-white/30 relative\">\n\n    <!-- Container Lines & Corner Squares -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-6 pointer-events-none z-50 flex justify-between border-x border-[#2C1610]/10\">\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-1 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-[#2C1610]/30 bg-[#D9C5B2]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -left-1 w-2 h-2 border border-[#2C1610]/30 bg-[#D9C5B2]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-2 h-2 border border-[#2C1610]/30 bg-[#D9C5B2]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 w-2 h-2 border border-[#2C1610]/30 bg-[#D9C5B2]\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Presentation Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1200px] aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-[16/9] bg-[#2C1610] shadow-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center border border-black/20\">\n\n        <!-- Premium Gradient Border Treatment -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-30 pointer-events-none\" style=\"border: 1px solid transparent; border-image: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(224,122,95,0.6) 0%, transparent 30%, transparent 70%, rgba(233,196,106,0.5) 100%) 1;\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Background Grid -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-20 pointer-events-none\"\n             style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(244, 162, 97, 0.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(244, 162, 97, 0.5) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;\">\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Canvas for WebGL-style Line Animation -->\n        <canvas id=\"barCanvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 w-full h-full pointer-events-none\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- Center Content area with Masked Reveal -->\n        <div class=\"relative z-20 flex flex-col items-center\">\n\n            <!-- Staggered Word Reveal -->\n            <div class=\"flex space-x-3 md:space-x-5 overflow-hidden mb-6 px-4\">\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n                    <h1 class=\"glitch-text text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-white reveal-elem transform translate-y-full inline-block\">\n                        Retry\n                    </h1>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden\">\n                    <h1 class=\"glitch-text text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-[#E07A5F] reveal-elem transform translate-y-full inline-block\">\n                        Sunset.\n                    </h1>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Badge with Border Gradient -->\n            <div class=\"overflow-hidden p-[1px] relative reveal-elem transform translate-y-full opacity-0\">\n                <!-- Gradient Border Simulator -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#E07A5F] via-[#F4A261] to-[#E9C46A] animate-[spin_4s_linear_infinite] opacity-80\" style=\"width: 200%; height: 200%; top: -50%; left: -50%;\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative bg-[#D9C5B2] text-[#2C1610] px-4 py-1.5 flex items-center gap-2 group cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:record-circle-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-normal tracking-widest uppercase mt-[1px]\">Earthworks</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // GSAP Animations\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", () => {\n            gsap.to(\".reveal-elem\", {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n        });\n\n        // Glitch Effect\n        const glitchTexts = document.querySelectorAll('.glitch-text');\n        setInterval(() => {\n            if (Math.random() > 0.8) {\n                glitchTexts.forEach(node => {\n                    const isGlitching = Math.random() > 0.4;\n                    if (isGlitching) {\n                        const shiftX = Math.random() * 8 - 4;\n                        const shiftY = Math.random() * 4 - 2;\n                        const skew = Math.random() * 10 - 5;\n\n                        node.style.transform = `translate(${shiftX}px, ${shiftY}px) skewX(${skew}deg)`;\n                        node.style.textShadow = `${shiftX * 1.5}px 0px rgba(224,122,95,0.8), ${shiftX * -1.5}px 0px rgba(233,196,106,0.8)`;\n\n                        setTimeout(() => {\n                            node.style.transform = 'none';\n                            node.style.textShadow = 'none';\n                        }, 60);\n                    }\n                });\n            }\n        }, 100);\n\n        // Canvas Simulation for WebGL-style lines\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('barCanvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n        // Earth/Sunset Color Palette\n        const colors = ['#E07A5F', '#F4A261', '#E9C46A', '#8B572A', '#ffffff'];\n        const gridSize = 24;\n        let blocks = [];\n\n        function resizeCanvas() {\n            canvas.width = canvas.parentElement.clientWidth;\n            canvas.height = canvas.parentElement.clientHeight;\n            initBlocks();\n        }\n\n        function initBlocks() {\n            blocks = [];\n            const colsCount = Math.ceil(canvas.width / gridSize);\n            const rowsCount = Math.ceil(canvas.height / gridSize);\n\n            const flankWidth = Math.floor(colsCount * 0.35);\n            const numBlocks = (canvas.width > 768) ? 120 : 60;\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < numBlocks; i++) {\n                const isLeft = Math.random() > 0.5;\n                let col;\n                if (isLeft) {\n                    col = Math.floor(Math.random() * flankWidth);\n                } else {\n                    col = colsCount - 1 - Math.floor(Math.random() * flankWidth);\n                }\n\n                if(Math.random() > 0.7 && isLeft) col = Math.floor(Math.random() * (flankWidth/2));\n                if(Math.random() > 0.7 && !isLeft) col = colsCount - 1 - Math.floor(Math.random() * (flankWidth/2));\n\n                blocks.push({\n                    x: col * gridSize,\n                    y: Math.floor(Math.random() * rowsCount) * gridSize,\n                    h: (Math.floor(Math.random() * 5) + 2) * gridSize,\n                    c: colors[Math.floor(Math.random() * colors.length)],\n                    speed: (Math.random() * 0.8 + 0.2) * (Math.random() > 0.5 ? 1 : -1),\n                    targetAlpha: Math.random() * 0.7 + 0.1,\n                    alpha: 0\n                });\n            }\n        }\n\n        function animateCanvas() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n\n            blocks.forEach(b => {\n                b.y += b.speed;\n\n                if (b.speed > 0 && b.y > canvas.height) {\n                    b.y = -b.h;\n                    b.x = getNewXPos();\n                } else if (b.speed < 0 && b.y < -b.h) {\n                    b.y = canvas.height;\n                    b.x = getNewXPos();\n                }\n\n                b.alpha += (b.targetAlpha - b.alpha) * 0.05;\n                if(Math.abs(b.targetAlpha - b.alpha) < 0.01) {\n                    b.targetAlpha = Math.random() * 0.8 + 0.1;\n                }\n\n                // Add slight glitch jitter to canvas block opacity\n                const currentAlpha = Math.random() > 0.98 ? 0 : b.alpha;\n\n                ctx.globalAlpha = currentAlpha;\n                ctx.fillStyle = b.c;\n                ctx.fillRect(b.x + 1, b.y + 1, gridSize - 1, b.h - 1);\n            });\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(animateCanvas);\n        }\n\n        function getNewXPos() {\n            const colsCount = Math.ceil(canvas.width / gridSize);\n            const flankWidth = Math.floor(colsCount * 0.35);\n            const isLeft = Math.random() > 0.5;\n            let col = isLeft ? Math.floor(Math.random() * flankWidth) : colsCount - 1 - Math.floor(Math.random() * flankWidth);\n            return col * gridSize;\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resizeCanvas);\n        resizeCanvas();\n        animateCanvas();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "retry-sunset-landing.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/retry-sunset-landing.jpg", "source_name": "retry-sunset-landing-DESIGN.md", "views": 66, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T00:38:18.206289+00:00"}